This project includes an adapted configuration from
Johnshall/Shadowrocket-ADBlock-Rules-Forever, by Moshel and Johnshall:
https://github.com/Johnshall/Shadowrocket-ADBlock-Rules-Forever

Changes: priority Apple Intelligence, Siri and ChatGPT proxy rules;
removal of Siri/location proxy bypass entries; automated upstream synchronization.

